#: libgnomekbd/gkbd-keyboard-drawing.c:2457
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Keyboard layout \"%s\"\n"
"Copyright &#169; X.Org Foundation and XKeyboardConfig contributors\n"
"For licensing see package metadata"
